abstract: >-
  Terraform module to manage Azure cost anomaly alert rules. Create cost anomaly alert rules to receive daily/weekly/monthly detailed alerts by email. Support only Azure subscription, other scopes such as billing account (EA/MCA/MPA) or resource groups aren't supported by this service.
